@startuml KTOB_05_deployment
title KTOB - R1 Deployment (physical nodes)
node "Reader device" {
 artifact "Web browser" as Browser
}
cloud "Vercel" {
 artifact "Angular static client" as Angular
}
cloud "Render Free" {
 node "One Spring Boot Docker runtime" {
  artifact "KTOB Java application" as Backend
 }
}
cloud "Supabase" {
 database "PostgreSQL [private app schema]" as Database
 component "Supabase Auth" as Auth
}
cloud "External providers" {
 component "Open Library" as OL
 component "AI provider [PROPOSED]" as AI
 component "Seller research [BLOCKED]" as Seller
}
Browser --> Angular : HTTPS
Browser --> Backend : HTTPS REST / JSON
Browser --> Auth : Sign-in and token
Backend --> Auth : Token verification
Backend --> Database : TLS PostgreSQL
Backend --> OL : Catalog requests
Backend --> AI : Consent-gated requests
Backend ..> Seller : Not configured
note right of Backend
Single deployable, multiple logical modules.
No separate microservice instances implied.
end note
note bottom of Database
Private business tables are not browser-facing.
RLS in exposed schemas; owner checks in Java.
end note
@enduml
